      "id": "claim_ef3053c6377a45268d30b21981f3a2fa",
      "statement": "Builds run through Vite+ (vp) tasks: a cached vp run strips the environment to a built-in set, so env reads must be declared on the task (workshop-frontend's build declares env: ['VITE_*'] because those values are inlined into the bundle), and a task may not share a name with a package.json script.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/workshop-backend/vite.config.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:58b82ed7d88c324b8772c9791e5011b74931bd0c9c7dc7250bd5d937dcdba132"
