    {
      "id": "claim_b09fe9e3cbaf4e72ab2bbcd817603e78",
      "statement": "workshop-backend's build and its codegen steps are cache: false rather than declaring FORMAT_BLUEPRINTS_DIR as env, because env fingerprints the variable's value rather than the contents of the outside-directory it names — edits inside the blueprint directory would otherwise replay a stale generated module.",
      "evidence": [
