      "statement": "build-release.ts bundles every deployable worker byte-identically via wrangler dry-run with the repo's pinned wrangler, builds the Access-mode frontend, and writes a content-addressed output (modules/<sha256>, assets/<cfHash>, manifest.json last) with release ids defaulting to r<CI_PIPELINE_IID>-<sha7> in CI and dev-<timestamp> locally.",
