    {
      "id": "claim_81d27e75974f4393a70fd7f1486a92c1",
      "statement": "upload-release.ts mirrors the release to R2 via the S3 API with content-addressed deduplication, uploading the manifest LAST so its presence under releases/<id>/manifest.json marks the release complete; with --candidate the manifest lands under candidates/<id>/, invisible to the deploy service until promotion.",
